WEBVTT

00:10:31.329 --> 00:10:34.454
The explosion of data sources, however,

00:10:34.496 --> 00:10:36.746
is really beyond the capacity
of the human mind

00:10:36.787 --> 00:10:38.121
to effectively integrate.

00:10:38.162 --> 00:10:39.829
We're now getting help from AI,

00:10:39.871 --> 00:10:43.204
or as I call it, IA,
intelligence augmentation.

00:10:43.246 --> 00:10:47.287
IA is being leveraged
in reading CT scans to diagnose COVID,

00:10:47.329 --> 00:10:49.579
to enhancing the vision
of a gastroenterologist

00:10:49.621 --> 00:10:50.996
performing a colonoscopy

00:10:51.037 --> 00:10:53.204
to identify lesions
they might have missed.

00:10:53.246 --> 00:10:55.704
And AI is playing
an active role in helping identify

00:10:55.746 --> 00:10:58.121
and develop new antivirals.

00:10:58.162 --> 00:11:02.371
And while AI is often perceived
as a threat by some clinicians,